<title>UK: JP Morgan leads 240 million stg asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan leads 240 million stg asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHESTER ASSET RECEIVABLES DEALINGS NO.3 LTD</p>
<p> AMT    240 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    05.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.311</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    99.889</p>
<p> NOTES	IBCA RATING IS AAA.</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.111     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
